body+=section('Document relationship, mapped part or candidate alternate?',kv([('Document succession','An official record names the replacement standard.'),('Full part-number mapping','A complete-designation mapping must be reviewed with its applicable notes.'),('Candidate alternate','A possible substitute still requires the applicable engineering and quality review.')],'Three cross-reference relationship types')+'<p>Every relationship in the table above is a document-level finding. It is not a list of commercial interchangeables.</p>','HOW TO INTERPRET A RESULT')
